# The build context is the repository root (`just image`). The
# image builds only the Cargo workspace. The TypeScript package stays out so
# unrelated edits do not bust the build cache. The Rust client is a workspace
# member, so its manifest has to be present for `cargo fetch`.
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/operator.json
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
.github
client/sdk
examples
gateway
*.md
package.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
tsconfig.json
eslint.config.js
tests/*.sh
xtask/*.ts
xtask/tsconfig.json
decryption-service/deploy
